[{:db/id 17592186192675 :knowledge-point/questions ["question-127fa900-d0ee-5472-8744-cd34e4c53e66"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id 17592186192677 :knowledge-point/questions ["question-a75bec48-b401-5e54-9492-da413551ed38" "question-e9404e17-b865-57fd-909a-78dee18906a5"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "question-127fa900-d0ee-5472-8744-cd34e4c53e66" :question/id #uuid "127fa900-d0ee-5472-8744-cd34e4c53e66" :question/math-academy-id "q-130749" :question/problem "Given that $X$ is a continuous random variable with the following probability density function, compute $\\text{E}[X].$\n\n$$\nf(x)=\\frac{1}{4},\\,1\\le x\\le 5\n$$" :question/worked-solution "For a continuous random variable $X$ with probability density function $f(x)$ defined over a set $S,$ we can calculate the expected value using the following formula:\n\n$$\n\\text{E}[X]={\\int }_{S}x\\cdot f(x)\\,\\text{d}x\n$$\n\n \n\nWe compute the expected value of $X$ as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\text{E}[X] & ={\\int }_{1}^{5}x\\cdot \\frac{1}{4}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & ={\\frac{{x}^{2}}{8}|}_{1}^{5} \\\\  & =3\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-3f402d38-49c1-5e1d-b58d-e1f178a38452"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-3f402d38-49c1-5e1d-b58d-e1f178a38452" :answer-field/id #uuid "3f402d38-49c1-5e1d-b58d-e1f178a38452" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-ccbfa58e-1e5f-509f-a3c9-671cbe6dad12" :answer-field/choices ["answer-ccbfa58e-1e5f-509f-a3c9-671cbe6dad12" "answer-0f145481-8341-5aa9-b9e3-47ac9653f08d" "answer-9f712d04-0ef8-55d5-9a8f-397f6820dd55" "answer-0bf2a96f-c565-51af-882e-08be99dbe9d4" "answer-88a2d585-fec7-597e-b2b4-33c9d14e2a1a"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-ccbfa58e-1e5f-509f-a3c9-671cbe6dad12" :answer/id #uuid "ccbfa58e-1e5f-509f-a3c9-671cbe6dad12" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "3" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-0f145481-8341-5aa9-b9e3-47ac9653f08d" :answer/id #uuid "0f145481-8341-5aa9-b9e3-47ac9653f08d" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "4" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-9f712d04-0ef8-55d5-9a8f-397f6820dd55" :answer/id #uuid "9f712d04-0ef8-55d5-9a8f-397f6820dd55" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{15}{4}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-0bf2a96f-c565-51af-882e-08be99dbe9d4" :answer/id #uuid "0bf2a96f-c565-51af-882e-08be99dbe9d4" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{21}{8}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-88a2d585-fec7-597e-b2b4-33c9d14e2a1a" :answer/id #uuid "88a2d585-fec7-597e-b2b4-33c9d14e2a1a" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{7}{2}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "question-a75bec48-b401-5e54-9492-da413551ed38" :question/id #uuid "a75bec48-b401-5e54-9492-da413551ed38" :question/math-academy-id "q-130875" :question/problem "Given that $X$ is a continuous random variable with the following probability density function, compute $\\text{E}[X].$\n\n$$\nf(x)=\\{\\begin{aligned}x, & 0<x<1 \\\\ \\frac{1}{{x}^{2}}, & 1\\le x<2\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/worked-solution "For a continuous random variable $X$ with probability density function $f(x)$ defined over a set $S,$ we can calculate the expected value using the following formula:\n\n$$\n\\text{E}[X]={\\int }_{S}x\\cdot f(x)\\,\\text{d}x\n$$\n\n \n\nWe compute the expected value of $X$ as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\text{E}[X] & ={\\int }_{0}^{2}x\\cdot f(x)\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{1}x\\cdot f(x)\\,\\text{d}x+{\\int }_{1}^{2}x\\cdot f(x)\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{1}x\\cdot x\\,\\text{d}x+{\\int }_{1}^{2}x\\cdot \\frac{1}{{x}^{2}}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{1}{x}^{2}\\,\\text{d}x+{\\int }_{1}^{2}\\frac{1}{x}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & ={\\frac{{x}^{3}}{3}|}_{0}^{1}+\\operatorname{ln}⁡x{|}_{1}^{2} \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{3}+\\operatorname{ln}⁡2-0 \\\\  & =\\operatorname{ln}⁡2+\\frac{1}{3}\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-13b91257-68b8-500a-b201-47daf0478002"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-13b91257-68b8-500a-b201-47daf0478002" :answer-field/id #uuid "13b91257-68b8-500a-b201-47daf0478002" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-dea7c8b5-a396-5c8c-a3e3-22fae9de2f74" :answer-field/choices ["answer-32f46f92-c0b7-5b8c-84c6-59f108c961fb" "answer-0ae0644f-0546-5bc1-aec6-a8d55d6d7d27" "answer-65952301-d738-5c6a-b6fc-b85df8529a6a" "answer-dea7c8b5-a396-5c8c-a3e3-22fae9de2f74" "answer-c503e550-36c6-5d75-ad74-9d8d0ffca904"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-32f46f92-c0b7-5b8c-84c6-59f108c961fb" :answer/id #uuid "32f46f92-c0b7-5b8c-84c6-59f108c961fb" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{1}{2}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-0ae0644f-0546-5bc1-aec6-a8d55d6d7d27" :answer/id #uuid "0ae0644f-0546-5bc1-aec6-a8d55d6d7d27" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{1}{3}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-65952301-d738-5c6a-b6fc-b85df8529a6a" :answer/id #uuid "65952301-d738-5c6a-b6fc-b85df8529a6a" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\operatorname{ln}⁡2" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-dea7c8b5-a396-5c8c-a3e3-22fae9de2f74" :answer/id #uuid "dea7c8b5-a396-5c8c-a3e3-22fae9de2f74" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\operatorname{ln}⁡2+\\frac{1}{3}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-c503e550-36c6-5d75-ad74-9d8d0ffca904" :answer/id #uuid "c503e550-36c6-5d75-ad74-9d8d0ffca904" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\operatorname{ln}⁡2-\\frac{1}{3}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "question-e9404e17-b865-57fd-909a-78dee18906a5" :question/id #uuid "e9404e17-b865-57fd-909a-78dee18906a5" :question/math-academy-id "q-130871" :question/problem "Given that $X$ is a continuous random variable with the following probability density function, compute $\\text{E}[X].$\n\n$$\nf(x)=\\{\\begin{aligned}\\frac{1}{2}, & 0<x<1 \\\\ \\frac{1}{2x}, & 1\\le x<e\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/worked-solution "For a continuous random variable $X$ with probability density function $f(x)$ defined over a set $S,$ we can calculate the expected value using the following formula:\n\n$$\n\\text{E}[X]={\\int }_{S}x\\cdot f(x)\\,\\text{d}x\n$$\n\n \n\nWe compute the expected value of $X$ as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\text{E}[X] & ={\\int }_{0}^{e}x\\cdot f(x)\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{1}x\\cdot f(x)\\,\\text{d}x+{\\int }_{1}^{e}x\\cdot f(x)\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{1}x\\cdot \\frac{1}{2}\\,\\text{d}x+{\\int }_{1}^{e}x\\cdot \\frac{1}{2x}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{1}\\frac{x}{2}\\,\\text{d}x+{\\int }_{1}^{e}\\frac{1}{2}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & ={\\frac{{x}^{2}}{4}|}_{0}^{1}+{\\frac{x}{2}|}_{1}^{e} \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{4}+\\frac{e}{2}-\\frac{1}{2} \\\\  & =\\frac{2e-1}{4}\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-b56cdda3-d5c2-5ae0-8fb8-26559a6d5135"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-b56cdda3-d5c2-5ae0-8fb8-26559a6d5135" :answer-field/id #uuid "b56cdda3-d5c2-5ae0-8fb8-26559a6d5135" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-70653d2a-2e94-5850-abe7-6d163b8005a4" :answer-field/choices ["answer-f493205a-4bbe-5f60-96f9-afe578c94f3f" "answer-637130b5-f7d6-51c6-b45d-c736d39b3a74" "answer-70653d2a-2e94-5850-abe7-6d163b8005a4" "answer-814d0b3f-29a5-5f01-b16e-f12a0f9ff292" "answer-201c2488-3b9d-5108-a48b-2c3d64cef328"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-f493205a-4bbe-5f60-96f9-afe578c94f3f" :answer/id #uuid "f493205a-4bbe-5f60-96f9-afe578c94f3f" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "1" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-637130b5-f7d6-51c6-b45d-c736d39b3a74" :answer/id #uuid "637130b5-f7d6-51c6-b45d-c736d39b3a74" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{2e+3}{4}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-70653d2a-2e94-5850-abe7-6d163b8005a4" :answer/id #uuid "70653d2a-2e94-5850-abe7-6d163b8005a4" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{2e-1}{4}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-814d0b3f-29a5-5f01-b16e-f12a0f9ff292" :answer/id #uuid "814d0b3f-29a5-5f01-b16e-f12a0f9ff292" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{e+1}{2}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-201c2488-3b9d-5108-a48b-2c3d64cef328" :answer/id #uuid "201c2488-3b9d-5108-a48b-2c3d64cef328" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{e-1}{2}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id 17592186193073 :question/problem "Given that $X$ is a continuous random variable with the following probability density function, compute $\\text{E}[5X-2].$\n\n$$\nf(x)=\\{\\begin{aligned}1-{x}^{3}, & 0<x\\le 1, \\\\ \\frac{1}{8}, & 1\\le x<3.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/worked-solution "First, we simplify using the properties of the expected value:\n\n$$\n\\text{E}[5X-2]=5\\text{E}[X]-2\n$$\n\nFor a continuous random variable $X$ with probability density function $f(x)$ defined over a set $S,$ we can calculate the expected value using the following formula:\n\n$$\n\\text{E}[X]={\\int }_{S}x\\cdot f(x)\\,\\text{d}x.\n$$\n\nSo, we calculate the expected value of $X$ as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\text{E}[X] & ={\\int }_{0}^{3}x\\cdot f(x)\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{1}x\\cdot (1-{x}^{3})\\,\\text{d}x+{\\int }_{1}^{3}x\\cdot \\frac{1}{8}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{1}(x-{x}^{4})\\,\\text{d}x+{\\int }_{1}^{3}\\frac{x}{8}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & ={(\\frac{{x}^{2}}{2}-\\frac{{x}^{5}}{5})|}_{0}^{1}+{\\frac{{x}^{2}}{16}|}_{1}^{3} \\\\  & =(\\frac{1}{2}-\\frac{1}{5})-0+(\\frac{9}{16}-\\frac{1}{16})-0 \\\\  & =\\frac{3}{10}+\\frac{1}{2} \\\\  & =\\frac{4}{5}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\text{E}[5X-2] & =5\\text{E}[X]-2 \\\\  & =5\\cdot \\frac{4}{5}-2 \\\\  & =2.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id 17592186190324 :answer-field/correct 17592186190327 :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]}]
